      "revision": 1361149489,
      "text": "Xylopia frutescens is a tree species the genus Xylopia and family Annonaceae. Its native range is southern Mexico through Cuba, Central America, and tropical South America to Bolivia and southern Brazil."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Xylopia frutescens",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xylopia_frutescens",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 220130887,
      "text": "Xylopia frutescens est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Annonaceae C'est un petit arbre néotropical connu en Guyane sous les noms de lamoussé ou lanmousé (créole), yãwĩ'ɨ sili (Wayãpi), pukuu (Palikuyene) et pendjeku (Aluku)."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Xylopia frutescens",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xylopia_frutescens",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 70602788,
      "text": "Xylopia frutescens popularmente conhecida como pindaíba, coagerucu, embira, envira-branca,envira, jererecou, pau de embira, pejerecum, pijerecu, pimento-de-gentio, pimenta-do-sertão, pindaúba \né uma árvore da família Annonaceae."
    }
